{"version":1,"key":"card:243","content":{"id":243,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f7183335-bdc4-41e2-9f57-decde3ef5698","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合提供 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"forEach"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 API 让我们来遍历 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"forEach"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 接收一个回调函数，该回调函数接收三个参数："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a44ee106-40cd-4eee-9653-2703a930ae60","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"19b14df9-83f7-4863-8c75-adc1742372e6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6936c9c9-a319-4fe3-9ece-3069574a1187","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"集合中的元素"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a0115d37-0acc-4e1e-b5ad-c49d2489a7e6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b9717a6-196d-45c8-bc3e-463486d4d7f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"键值，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合没有键，因此该值与第一个参数的值相同"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"82ba4ddd-cc4f-45fe-8e92-19eb5857abbc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d9444171-245e-42ba-9a77-e953bdc68756","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合本身"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"d5ba66af-1e5c-4144-ad6c-daf1bea64c75","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4d9009c4-b8d8-4066-8f00-08fe5dd5c6d8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let set = new Set();\n\nset.add(1);\nset.add(3);\nset.add(4);\n\nset.forEach((value, _, ownerSet) => {\n  console.log(value);  // 1\n                       // 3\n                       // 4\n  console.assert(ownerSet === set);\n});","collabId":"2713e1ca-4d24-4725-8af2-fe389ba39b0e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"173a315f-94aa-44aa-a406-518621fb40e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果需要在回调函数中使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的话，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"forEach"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的第二个参数将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"this"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 传入"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"71827c7a-7306-4c52-83be-18b398779d86","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"78ef4bbd-3fd2-411d-bd2d-baf8e7733450","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let set = new Set([1, 2]);\n\nlet processor = {\n  output(value) {\n    console.log(value);\n  },\n  process(dataSet) {\n    dataSet.forEach((value) => {\n      this.output(value);\n    }, this);\n  },\n};\n\nprocessor.process(set);","collabId":"27b93d1e-cdf5-4ad7-9885-11862a244c48","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Set"],"createTime":1690984024894,"updateTime":1743303640412,"linkedCards":[{"id":242,"target":{"key":"card:242","type":"card","id":242},"summary":"Set 集合是一个有序的、没有重复元素的集合。通过 new Set() 得到一个 Set 对象， Set 集合提供如下 API add(item) ：向集合中添加元素 item has(item) ：判断集合中是否有 item 元素 del...","tags":["JavaScript/Set"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640412}}